{"timestamp":1774907753402,"source_app":"agentic-harness","session_id":"f2b334c9-dcb1-4703-bb7f-0a76d257c760","hook_event_type":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_01TxUmwfCNYBkPBiE4B7LoQk","payload":{"session_id":"f2b334c9-dcb1-4703-bb7f-0a76d257c760","transcript_path":"/Users/rivero/.claude/projects/-Users-rivero-ai-agentic-experience-apps-mas-trees-3b78e2c1/f2b334c9-dcb1-4703-bb7f-0a76d257c760.jsonl","cwd":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/3b78e2c1","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","hook_event_name":"PreToolUse","tool_name":"Write","tool_input":{"file_path":"/Users/rivero/ai/agentic-experience/apps/mas/trees/3b78e2c1/specs/patch/patch-adw--fix-folder-path-startswith.md","content":"# Patch: Fix folder path prefix false-positive in copyFragment\n\n## Metadata\nadw_id: ``\nreview_change_request: `In mas-repository.js:1019, existingTitles is collected using s.get()?.path?.startsWith(folderPath) which matches fragments in subdirectories (e.g. /folder/subfolder/) and folders sharing a name prefix (e.g. /folder-extra/). This results in unnecessary -1 suffixes when the exact folder has no collision, but never in a missed dedup. Resolution: Replace startsWith check with exact folder comparison: s.get()?.path?.split('/').slice(0,-1).join('/') === folderPath`\n\n## Issue Summary\n**Original Spec:** N/A\n**Issue:** `startsWith(folderPath)` in `copyFragment` collects titles from fragments outside the exact target folder \u2014 subdirectory fragments (e.g. `/folder/subfolder/item`) and sibling folders sharing a name prefix (e.g. `/folder-extra/item`) are incorrectly included in `existingTitles`. This causes `generateUniqueTitle` to append unnecessary `-1` suffixes even when no real title collision exists in the exact folder.\n**Solution:** Replace `startsWith` with an exact parent-folder comparison by deriving the fragment's parent path via `split('/').slice(0,-1).join('/')` and comparing it strictly with `===` to `folderPath`.\n\n## Files to Modify\n\n- `studio/src/mas-repository.js` \u2014 line 1019, inside `copyFragment`\n\n## Implementation Steps\n\n### Step 1: Replace `startsWith` with exact folder equality check\n- In `studio/src/mas-repository.js` at line 1019, change:\n  ```js\n  .map((s) => (s.get?.()?.path?.startsWith(folderPath) ? s.get()?.title : null))\n  ```\n  to:\n  ```js\n  .map((s) => (s.get?.()?.path?.split('/').slice(0, -1).join('/') === folderPath ? s.get()?.title : null))\n  ```\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\n# 1. Verify syntax is valid\nnode --check studio/src/mas-repository.js\n\n# 2. Confirm startsWith is no longer used for this path check\ngrep -n \"startsWith(folderPath)\" studio/src/mas-repository.js\n\n# 3. Confirm the new exact comparison is present\ngrep -n \"slice(0, -1).join.*=== folderPath\" studio/src/mas-repository.js\n```\n\n## Patch Scope\n**Lines of code to change:** 1\n**Risk level:** low\n**Testing required:** Syntax check on the modified JS file; grep confirmation that the exact-match pattern is in place and `startsWith` is removed.\n"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TxUmwfCNYBkPBiE4B7LoQk"}}
